"Providers" = "供應商";
"Data Sources" = "資料來源";
"Diagnostics" = "診斷紀錄";
"About" = "關於";
"Language" = "語言";
"General" = "一般";
"Launch at Login" = "登入時自動啟動";
"Menu Bar Layout" = "選單列排列";
"Draws both gauges in one icon, using about half the width. Each provider keeps its letter and outline color, so they remain distinguishable. Use this when menu bar space is limited." = "兩個量表畫在同一個圖示裡，佔用寬度減半。字母與外框顏色都保留，仍分得出誰是誰。選單列空間不足時用這個。";
"Layout" = "版面";
"The outline color identifies the provider, while the fill height shows the percentage used. The letter is a second, color-independent cue for color-vision differences or similar outline colors." = "外框顏色代表是哪個供應商，內部填色高度代表已用比例。字母是不依賴顏色的第二個線索，色覺障礙或兩色相近時仍分得出來。";
"When both providers are disabled, a neutral menu bar icon remains as an entry point so you can reopen Settings." = "兩個供應商都關閉時，選單列會保留一個中性圖示作為入口，否則就再也打不開這個設定視窗了。";
"Outline Color" = "外框顏色";
"Refresh Interval" = "更新頻率";
"Data Status" = "資料狀態";
"Menu Bar Display" = "選單列顯示";
"Leave blank to auto-detect" = "留空時自動偵測";
"Apply" = "套用";
"Use Auto-Detection" = "改用自動偵測";
"The app uses Process to execute this file directly with the fixed arguments `app-server --listen stdio://`. It does not use a shell or start a sign-in flow." = "只會用 Process 直接執行這個檔案與固定參數 `app-server --listen stdio://`；不經 shell，也不會啟動登入。";
"This app is not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic or OpenAI. All icons are original designs and do not use official logos." = "本 App 與 Anthropic 及 OpenAI 均無隸屬關係，也未獲其背書。所有圖示為原創設計，未使用任何官方標誌。";
"Refresh" = "重新整理";
"Settings…" = "設定…";
"Quit App" = "結束 App";
"Copy Claude Code recovery command" = "複製 Claude Code 修復指令";
"Recovery command copied" = "已複製修復指令";
"No trustworthy usage data is currently available." = "目前沒有可信的額度資料。";
"Currently binding" = "目前綁定";
"The values below are from the last successful query, not the current values." = "以下數字為最後一次成功查詢的結果，不是現在的值。";
"Claude Code Executable" = "Claude Code 執行檔";
"Command Run" = "實際執行的指令";
"The app executes this file directly with those fixed arguments. It does not use a shell, and the arguments cannot be changed from settings or influenced by a response. The query is read-only: it runs no model and consumes no conversation quota." = "App 直接執行這個檔案與上面那組固定參數，不經 shell；參數無法從設定更改，也不受任何回應影響。這是唯讀查詢：不跑模型，也不消耗對話額度。";
"The app never signs you in. If Claude Code is signed out, the panel offers `claude` for you to copy and run yourself." = "App 不會替你登入。Claude Code 未登入時，面板會提供 `claude` 讓你自己複製到終端機執行。";
"Since 0.3.0 this app no longer reads your Keychain credential. Claude Code handles its own sign-in." = "0.3.0 起，App 不再讀取你的鑰匙圈憑證；登入由 Claude Code 自己處理。";
"How Fresh the Claude Figures Are" = "Claude 的數字有多新";
"Claude Code attaches a structured usage report to `/usage`. When it could not reach the server, that report holds no figures, and the app marks the last reading as stale instead of showing the older numbers Claude Code still prints. Verified with the network blocked." = "Claude Code 會在 `/usage` 的結果附上一份結構化的用量報告。它連不上伺服器時，報告裡不會有數字；App 這時把上一筆讀數標成「過期」，而不是顯示 Claude Code 仍會印出的舊數字。已在封鎖網路的情況下實測。";
"A reading can still be about a minute old, because Claude Code briefly reuses a fresh answer. An older Claude Code attaches no report; the app then reads the printed text, which can come from a local cache with no as-of time, and bounds it by the reset time. That does not catch staleness within the current window — up to five hours for the session limit." = "讀數仍可能是大約一分鐘內的舊值，因為 Claude Code 會短暫沿用剛取得的結果。較舊的 Claude Code 不附報告，App 就改讀它印出的文字；那段文字可能來自本機快取、沒有附上「幾點拿到的」，只能用重置時間推估上限。擋不到的是同一個窗內的落後 —— session 窗最多五小時。";
"Rate limits apply per account. The query runs through Claude Code itself rather than as a direct call from this app, so throttling is handled by the CLI. Whether a throttled lookup reports no figures or its last known ones has not been observed." = "限流以帳號計算。查詢透過 Claude Code 自己執行，而不是本 App 直接發送，所以限流由 CLI 處理。被限流時報告是沒有數字、還是帶著上次已知的數字，目前還沒有觀察到。";
"Copies `claude`. Paste it into Terminal to launch Claude Code once. If prompted, finish signing in, then return and click Refresh. This app runs the read-only /usage query, but never signs you in." = "複製 `claude`。請貼到終端機並啟動一次 Claude Code；若出現提示，再完成登入，然後回來按「重新整理」。本 App 只會執行唯讀的 /usage 查詢，不會替你登入。";
